ank%20you%20for%20your%20punctuality%2C%20Mr.%20Hauken.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e1","era":null,"summary":"Wicker questions Nellick about why geists would target him, and Jacob advises him to stay inside and get wards.","participants":["eloise-wicker","lord-nellick","jacob-hauken"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"minor","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":19,"quote":"\"Stay inside, Lord Nellick, though I'm sure I don't have to tell you that nowadays.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22Stay%20inside%2C%20Lord%20Nellick%2C,tell%20you%20that%20nowadays.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Edge of the World","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Aysha U. Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22Stay%20inside%2C%20Lord%20Nellick%2C,tell%20you%20that%20nowadays.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e2","era":null,"summary":"Wicker shakes Nellick's hand, goes still, and then hurriedly leads Jacob away, telling him to call her Eloise.","participants":["eloise-wicker","lord-nellick","jacob-hauken"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"major","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":31,"quote":"\"You can call me Eloise,\" she says","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22You%20can%20call%20me%20Elois