":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e6","era":null,"summary":"Eloise touches Jacob's face and thanks him for his story, and he feels something oily try to slide beneath his skin.","participants":["eloise-wicker","jacob-hauken","cyril-rav"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"minor","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":108,"quote":"She touches cold fingertips to his face.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=She%20touches%20cold%20fingertips%20to%20his%20face.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Edge of the World","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Aysha U. Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=She%20touches%20cold%20fingertips%20to%20his%20face.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e7","era":null,"summary":"A physician examines Eloise and speaks oddly to Jacob; later Eloise says she remembers nothing after the merchant's cold hands.","participants":["the-physician","eloise-wicker","jacob-hauken"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"minor","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":125,"quote":"\"I remember . . . the merchant in the tower.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22I%20remember%20.%20.,merchant%20in%20the%20tower.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Edge of the World","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Aysha U. Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22I%20remember%20.%20.,merchant%20in%20the%20tower.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e8","era":null,"summary":"The geist returns, and Jacob uses his own blood to draw a seal that lets her speak; she names herself Millicent and says a man used her community's spirits.","participants":["jacob-hauken","millicent","eloise-wicker","blood-seal"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"major","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":155,"quote":"\"Millicent. That was my name.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22Millicent.%20That%20was%20my%20name.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Edge of the World","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Aysha U. Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22Millicent.%20That%20was%20my%20name.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e9","era":null,"summary":"Millicent's account and Eloise's lack of memory lead Jacob to realize that the necro-alchemist is possessing people.","participants":["jacob-hauken","millicent","eloise-wicker","cyril-rav"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"major","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":171,"quote":"Once again, she looks at Eloise. And Jacob understands.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=Once%20again%2C%20she%20looks,Eloise.%20And%20Jacob%20understands.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Edge of the World","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Aysha U. Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=Once%20again%2C%20she%20looks,Eloise.%20And%20Jacob%20understands.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e10","era":null,"summary":"Jacob visits Nellick, asks about Cyril Rav, feels possession begin and pushes the necro-alchemist out.","participants":["jacob-hauken","lord-nellick","cyril-rav"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"major","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":181,"quote":"\"Have you ever possessed a geistmage before? I promise you won't like it.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22Have%20you%20ever%20possessed,you%20won%27t%20like%20it.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Edge of the World","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Aysha U. Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22Have%20you%20ever%20possessed,you%20won%27t%20like%20it.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e11","era":null,"summary":"Rav, in Nellick's body, admits he hired Jacob, that the geistbomb misfired and 